  "rationale": "Define and statically prove the only route by which the isolated v44 fixed-lag core may consume the three exact v44a canonical LiDAR/IMU bags. The adapter restores deterministic header-time order through a bounded receive-time watermark, supplies only immutable sensor records and fixed source calibration to the core, checks RSS and processing RTF after every completed scan, hashes retained v17 state and map artifacts before and after execution, and writes only bounded diagnostic evidence. This static gate does not open a bag or execute a replay.",
